{
  "_comment": [
    "Which feature each unit-test class belongs to. CI runs one job per area, so a failure reads",
    "'Unit tests (Voice & Assist)' instead of a package name. Areas are by feature, not by package:",
    "data.ha holds connection and voice tests, ui.cards holds card and camera tests.",
    "Every top-level class in app/src/test must appear here exactly once; .github/scripts/test_areas.py",
    "fails CI otherwise, so a new test can never silently stop running. A helper class that is not a",
    "test (a shared fixture) goes in 'helpers'."
  ],
  "helpers": [],
